WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.497
Hi, I'm Pear!

00:00:02.497 --> 00:00:06.117
Qwen-Image-2.1 wants a big model to rewrite every request.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:08.531
Two small students learned that job.

00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:12.595
The pocket models skip the system prompt and the thinking.

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:13.926
It's all in the weights.

00:00:18.925 --> 00:00:20.306
You type a short request.

00:00:20.306 --> 00:00:21.688
The rewriter reads it first.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:26.713
It returns one line of JSON: a long picture description and an aspect ratio.

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:31.882
That description joins the sequence all thirty-two blocks process: thirty-four tokens as

00:00:31.882 --> 00:00:35.444
typed, four hundred and forty-six from the small rewriter.

00:00:35.864 --> 00:00:39.700
Without a prefix cache, every denoising step pays for it: about one

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.298
point four times the cost.

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:46.850
The teacher reads a long system prompt, then thinks for about eight hundred tokens.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.188
The students get no system prompt.

00:00:49.188 --> 00:00:51.105
Their template closes the think block.

00:00:53.442 --> 00:00:58.104
A small model wrote eight thousand seven hundred and ninety-seven synthetic requests.

00:00:58.524 --> 00:00:59.966
The teacher rewrote each one.

00:01:01.455 --> 00:01:04.750
A hard filter kept rewrites of eighty to four hundred words.

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:07.695
The students trained on the survivors, two epochs.

00:01:08.842 --> 00:01:10.943
That word limit chose the curriculum.

00:01:10.943 --> 00:01:15.844
About seventy percent of stickers and logos got in, almost no posters or screens.

00:01:17.383 --> 00:01:21.499
One poster request, rendered four ways: as typed, and from each rewriter.

00:01:21.499 --> 00:01:22.527
One seed each.

00:01:22.947 --> 00:01:25.528
Only the teacher's rewrite put the title on the poster.

00:01:25.947 --> 00:01:28.028
The students had seen eleven posters.

00:01:28.028 --> 00:01:30.457
Their rewrites gave cityscapes with no text.

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:36.000
On four test renders, typed requests passed seven of nine checks.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.758
The small rewriter's passed one.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:44.576
The students copied the teacher's format, not yet its effect on pictures.

00:01:44.576 --> 00:01:46.993
And every rewrite lengthens the denoiser's work.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.412
A rewriter describes the picture.

00:01:50.412 --> 00:01:52.703
The students learned it without a prompt.

00:01:52.703 --> 00:01:54.667
A word limit chose their lessons.

00:01:55.087 --> 00:01:57.049
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:57.049 --> 00:01:57.609
I'm Pear.

00:01:57.609 --> 00:01:57.890
Bye!
